  <h2 id="checkpoint">Run it through The 4-Checkpoint Protocol before you commit</h2>

  <p>
    A single salary figure, or one relative's opinion about "biomedical science scope," cannot tell you
    whether this degree fits your specific life. The 4-Checkpoint Protocol narrows the decision to what
    actually matters for you.
  </p>

